DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/calls/apps/{app_id}
Deletes an app from Cloudflare Calls
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/calls/apps/{app_id}
Fetches details for a single Calls app.
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/calls/apps/{app_id}
Edit details for a single app.
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/calls/turn_keys/{key_id}
